      "value": "<ac:layout><ac:layout-section ac:type=\"two_right_sidebar\"><ac:layout-cell><h2>About the Feature</h2><h2>Used By</h2><h2><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">How is it used?</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">The Operation Theater App is available on the Home page of Bahmni.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><ac:image ac:border=\"true\" ac:height=\"686\" ac:width=\"500\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"Screen Shot 2018-06-18 at 4.57.26 PM.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);\">The steps to set up and configure&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Operation Theatre</span></span>&nbsp;can be found<span>&nbsp;</span></span>here<span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);\">.&nbsp;</span></span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51,51,51);\">To read about the details of using the&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);\">Operation Theater</span></span> feature, refer to the links below:</span></span></span></span></p><ul><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/703660044/Surgical+Block\">Surgical Block</a></li><li><a href=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/BAH/pages/703594508/Managing+Surgeries+in+a+Surgical+Block\">Managing Surgeries in a Surgical Block</a></li></ul><p><br /></p><p><br /></p></ac:layout-cell><ac:layout-cell><p class=\"auto-cursor-target\"><br /></p><ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"eee1f9bc-49bd-44f7-86a2-f81eae2f95ca\"><ac:rich-text-body><p><span>This module is available only from release 0.91 onwards.</span></p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p class